{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Versioned sidecar for KnoxChat models whose /v1/models entry advertises reasoning_effort but not reasoning.supported_efforts. Never used unless supported_parameters includes reasoning_effort (or supported_efforts is present). Prefer API metadata.reasoning when present.",
